aph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は個別です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の雰囲気だと\n今日、明日と2日連続\n会えるかたもたくさんいるのかな～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年中にやっておきたいことは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玉ねぎのおぬぬめな食べ方は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな朝ごはんのメニューは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\n答えを教えてください(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、握手会の後は\nらじらー！だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうキャッチフレーズは応募してくれました？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.nhk.or.jp/radirer/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日サンエトのキャッチフレーズが決まっちゃうんだね！\nどきどき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-25723":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝ごはん大好き( ﹡ˆoˆ﹡ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"諸事情により、さつまいもを\n大量に入手したので、\n毎日頑張って消費してます（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は、さつまいものお味噌汁を\n作りました  ♭♭\n美味しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、何でこんなにさつまいもを\n沢山頂いたのかというと...\nその謎は、明日、11月14日発売の\n『EX大衆』さんでわかります！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてEX大衆さんでソログラビアを\nやらせて頂きました！\nすごく嬉しかったし、楽しかったです(,,^_^,,)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"謎が解けない方は、ぜひぜひ、\n見てみてねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみにー\\(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、埼玉県の地元の近くの\n冬桜をお母さんと見に行ってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中で、真っ黒なイノシシに遭遇して\n熊かと思ってお母さんと2人で\nヒヤッとしました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅葉と桜、桜とイルミネーション、\n秋と春と冬がいっぺんに来たみたいな、\nそれぞれのコラボが\nとっても幻想的でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、これはお母さんです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りに、近くの温泉にも\n入ってきました ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉には良い所が沢山あるので、\nぜひ遊びにきてほしいなっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、そんなことを思ってたら、\nナイスタイミングで、\nBUBKAさんで埼玉出身メンバーの\n取材をして頂きました(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難い！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏、かなりん、伊織と、\n沢山地元トークができて\nすごく楽しかったです\\(  ˆoˆ  )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉県民の皆さんも、\n埼玉をまだまだ知らないよーって\n皆さんも、誰が読んでも\nきっと笑っちゃう楽しい内容になってるので、\nこれを読んで皆さんが笑顔に\nなってくれたらいいなっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月30日発売です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします♭♭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼でーん／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週の『乃木坂工事中』は、\nまりか、ひめたん、私の3人での\n温泉ロケ回です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかこのメンバーで\nロケに行かせて頂けるなんて...\n本当に嬉しかったです＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、プレゼンしてくれて\n有難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"企画してくださった番組さん、\n有難うございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝です_(__)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひ、見てくださーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うおー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ブランコで無邪気になるハタチ。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-9598":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/05/1616893/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺふぺふぺふっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、久しぶりの握手会ですね！！！\n２０１３年、初握手っ！＼(^o^)／ぺふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんに、明けましておめでとう～って\n言えるのが楽しみっ(*^o^*)♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、だいすきな ねねこーろと\n一緒だから高まりますっ！\nねねこーろファンのみなさまも、\n宜しくお願いしますっo(^_^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お外は寒いから、\n気をつけてきてねっ>_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら、風邪引かないよおに\nさゆにゃんがいっぱい\nあっためてあげるねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/05/1616893/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/05/1616893/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/05/1616893/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前にブログに書いた、まいまいと\nまいやんとの３人での撮影は、\nただいま発売中の、FLASHスペシャルのほうに、\n載っているそうです！\nみなさん、ぜひ見てくださいね～＼(^o^)／ぺふぺふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺぷ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/05/1616893/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/05/1616893/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/05/1616893/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/05/1616893/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/05/1616893/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/05/1616893/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/05/1616893/0010.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-570":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Blogの更新が遅くなってしまい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"申し訳ありませんでした；!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回か記事を書いたのですが…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は色々思うことが自分の中であって、どれも重くなってしまいまして；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今更ずーんと暗くなっても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果は変わらないので。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現実からいつまでも逃げるわけにはいかない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MAXに重い記事は、新年の時に投稿済みなので敢えて、いつものBlogな感じで書かせて頂きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はこれが一番自分らしいBlogだと思うので更新します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井、選抜メンバーに入りましたっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから、乃木坂46を代表して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山パフォーマンスを披露する機会があるから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂ってサイコーにイケてるアイドルグループだっ☆!!」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て一人でも多くの人に思ってもらえるように頑張るよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木どこ?終了直後から早速多くの方がコメントをくださって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん……優しすぎだよ；；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近本当に涙腺弱ってるんだからっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も撮影だったのに、みんなのせいで目腫れちゃって、腫れが引くまで大変だったんだよー!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、本当にありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんがいてくれるから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一から頑張ろうって思えるんだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に幸せ者だね、玲香は。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七福神落ちた事、落ち込んでると思いましたか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガッツリ落ち込みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガッツリ泣きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜入れたんだから、贅沢言うなよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思われるかもしれないけれど、これが私の本音です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって悔しいじゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七福神入りたいじゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のどこが駄目だったの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何で私じゃ駄目だったの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こう思うのって、普通でしょ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"……あ゛ぁー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の私、凄い嫌な奴だね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな風に思う自分は嫌いだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、この文章を読んでくださってる皆さん、本当にごめんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今だけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のBlogでだけだから言わせてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでしか言わないから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、言わないから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆さんの期待に応えられなかった事が凄く悔しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の今の実力では、七福神が務まらないと判断された事も凄く悔しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「最後にギリギリの滑り込みで入ることが出来た〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われた事がめちゃくちゃ悔しい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分にとってベストな結果を出すことが出来なくて悔しい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲間に、戦友に越されたことが悔しい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に悔しい!!悔しい!悔しい!悔しい!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、もうクヨクヨしないって新年迎えて決めたし!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと新しいスタートきったんだよ!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七福神を落ちた事で、今まで見えなくなっていた沢山の大切な事に気づくことが出来たんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の七福神落ちは、自分が成長するためには必要な事だったんだと思うんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一生に一度の人生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいことばかりじゃなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しいこと、辛いことも、同じくらい経験した方が面白いのよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言ってても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の結果はやっぱり悔しかったので(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか必ず、絶対!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"再び七福神を掴みに行きます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の背中を押してくれる人が一人でもいる限り、私は絶対に夢を掴みに行くことが出来ると思うから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて…よろしくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46、選抜、非選抜関係なく33人でお互いに支え合って頑張っていこうと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからの乃木坂46に期待していてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井玲香"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/09/120109_114558_3.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/09/120109_114640_3.jpg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-1318":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みな様こんにちゎ(∀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後です(*´∀`)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の日曜は、ディズニーへ行きました＝３"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、みなみと(。・ω・。)はぁと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったよ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type"